{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "1a0cbf7e-1efd-45cc-8ae1-e1d1a7c2164a",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3096",
            "content": {
                "en": "Excuse me, I see quite a few lanterns piled up next to your stall?",
                "zh": "您好，我看到摊位旁边似乎堆着不少花灯？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -70.66667175292969,
            "positionY": -326.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "278623af-895c-4da0-83fa-41f5684c1fd3",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "779d6973-0d9e-4e35-907e-61399def5193",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3097",
            "content": {
                "en": "Ah, are they blocking your way? I’m so sorry!",
                "zh": "啊，挡着您路了吗？真不好意思！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 292.6666564941406,
            "positionY": -323.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "867f8c1f-8ec9-44b3-a373-4b1b7ad850bc",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "779d6973-0d9e-4e35-907e-61399def5193",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3098",
            "content": {
                "en": "I want to get them all hung up as soon as possible, but as you can see…",
                "zh": "我也想尽快挂好这些花灯的，可是您瞧......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 669.3333740234375,
            "positionY": -321.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b7f32d01-389d-4597-9ee2-e3e7d8237a82",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "547590f1-5207-4943-a81f-41ae946214ce",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3099",
            "content": {
                "en": "(The stall owner is leaning on a crutch, and one leg is in a cast.)",
                "zh": "（摊主拄着拐杖，一只脚上还打着石膏。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1021.3333740234375,
            "positionY": -318.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "6d150be3-4fd9-4e8a-9f34-4d4b1ea77abf",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "779d6973-0d9e-4e35-907e-61399def5193",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3100",
            "content": {
                "en": "I twisted my ankle in an accident a couple of days ago, and my family is busy preparing our other shops, so no one has time to help me.",
                "zh": "前两天因为意外扭伤了脚，家里人都忙着别处店铺的准备，抽不开身来帮忙。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1389.333251953125,
            "positionY": -316.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0d527db1-5952-4aeb-9045-d68f3cb7694c",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "779d6973-0d9e-4e35-907e-61399def5193",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3101",
            "content": {
                "en": "I’ve had to set up the stall slowly by myself. Thankfully, the neighboring vendors have helped a lot; it’s just these lanterns left.",
                "zh": "我只好自己慢慢悠悠架摊子，还好相邻的摊主们帮了我不少忙，现在也就差这点花灯没挂上了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1751.333251953125,
            "positionY": -315.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "edfd6cf9-4fc2-4609-9813-21d3134daf11",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "547590f1-5207-4943-a81f-41ae946214ce",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3102",
            "content": {
                "en": "(I can’t just keep waiting like this. According to the info I had, the troupe should also have a stall at the fair.)",
                "zh": "（这样等下去也不是办法，根据之前的情报，戏团应该在大会会场也有摊位。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2116.0,
            "positionY": -310.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a1c6a496-0523-4864-985a-3929d2046522",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "547590f1-5207-4943-a81f-41ae946214ce",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3103",
            "content": {
                "en": "(I want to find their stall as soon as possible and see if I can gather some important information.)",
                "zh": "（我想尽快找到它们的摊位，看看能不能收集到比较重要的信息。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2514.666748046875,
            "positionY": -306.66668701171877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "bf10b53e-2e01-4687-b6f7-31c3f059c444",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3104",
            "content": {
                "en": "Well, how about I help you hang the lanterns?",
                "zh": "嗯，不如由我来帮您把花灯挂上吧。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2887.33349609375,
            "positionY": -304.66668701171877,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
